/* Power */
"Only keep Mac awake while connected to power" = "仅接通电源时保持 Mac 唤醒";
"Stop keeping Mac awake below" = "低于此电量时停止保持唤醒";
"Respect Low Power Mode" = "尊重低电量模式";
"Lets the Mac sleep when you turn on Low Power Mode. AgentBrew's own closed-lid switch doesn't count." = "开启低电量模式时允许 Mac 睡眠。AgentBrew 为闭盖自己切换的低电量模式不算在内。";
"Allow displays to sleep while agents are working" = "Agent 工作时允许显示器睡眠";
