/* Closed Lid */
"Keep agents working when the lid is closed" = "合盖时保持 Agent 工作";
"Use Low Power Mode while the lid is closed" = "合盖时使用低电量模式";
"Switches to Low Power Mode while agents work with the lid shut and no external display, then restores your own setting when the lid opens or the work stops." = "合盖且无外接显示器时切换到低电量模式；开盖或工作结束后恢复你的原有设置。";
"Background helper" = "后台助手";
"Repair Helper" = "修复助手";
"Required for closed-lid operation. The helper runs locally and releases its hold if communication with AgentBrew stops." = "闭盖运行的必要组件。助手仅在本地运行，与 AgentBrew 失去通信时会自动释放保持唤醒。";

/* About */
"Keeps your Mac awake while local agents work, then lets it sleep when they finish." = "本地 Agent 工作时保持 Mac 唤醒，工作结束后自动允许睡眠。";
"Uses a local background helper only when enabled. AgentBrew never sends your agent data off this Mac." = "仅在启用时使用本地后台助手。AgentBrew 绝不会把你的 Agent 数据发送到这台 Mac 之外。";
